建德同伏诛，戴州刺史孟噉鬼不自安，挟海公之子义以曹、戴二州反，以禹城令蒋善合为腹心；善合与其左右同谋斩之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":18263,"number":39,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百八十九 (唐紀五) / 高祖神堯大聖光孝皇帝中之中 / 武德四年 / 第 58 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":57,"tongjian_id":"b739e0af-db0e-11ef-a78f-a0d3651f611f","year_int":621},"tongjian_id":"b739e0af-db0e-11ef-a78f-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"禹城","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"禹城","place_name_jianti_auto":"禹城","place_note":"山东省禹城县","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"c3cca72f-db0e-11ef-b41d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"c3cca730-db0e-11ef-86f2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"祝阿縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"祝阿县","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"c3cca731-db0e-11ef-9037-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"禹城","place_name_jianti_auto":"禹城","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"c3cca732-db0e-11ef-9e8a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"禹息","place_name_jianti_auto":"禹息","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"c3cca733-db0e-11ef-a8d6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"齊州","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐州","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"c3cca734-db0e-11ef-8db2-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"之，往也，一作「屯」。禹城，漢祝阿縣地，天寶元年改爲禹城，以縣西有禹息古城也，屬齊州。九域志：在州西北一百三十里。","note_content_jianti_auto":"之，往也，一作「屯」。禹城，汉祝阿县地，天宝元年改为禹城，以县西有禹息古城也，属齐州。九域志：在州西北一百三十里。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"c3cca72e-db0e-11ef-b3c6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"禹城","place_name_jianti_auto":"禹城","place_note":"山东省禹城县","resolved_place_entity_id":5093,"start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"c3cca738-db0e-11ef-b247-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"2義成行營兵三千人先屯齊州，使之禹城，中道潰叛；橫海節度使李祐討誅之。","content_fanyi":"义成行营的三千名士兵原先屯驻在齐州，受命调往禹城，行至中途溃散反叛；新任横海节度使李祐率军讨伐，将他们诛灭。","content_jianti_auto":"2义成行营兵三千人先屯齐州，使之禹城，中道溃叛；横海节度使李祐讨诛之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":24731,"number":2,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百四十四 (唐紀六十) / 文宗元聖昭獻孝皇帝上之下 / 太和三年 / 第 2 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"c3cca72d-db0e-11ef-8ead-a0d3651f611f","year_int":829},"tongjian_id":"c3cca72d-db0e-11ef-8ead-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":2}],"page_size":10,"total_pages":1,"total_paragraphs":2},"place_name":"禹城"},"message":"success","success":true}